\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">11.40.5409<br/>July 25, 2017<br/>Summer Update 2017</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe <b>Museum of Tibian Arts</b> (MOTA) is an exhibition of several Tibian art pieces, curated by <a href=\"#/wiki/Gareth\">Gareth</a>. Inside the museum, however, strange things may happen. \n</p><p>On its second floor, the statues will come to life at <a href=\"#/wiki/Night\">Night</a>, making this a rather dangerous place because of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Guzzlemaw\">Animated Guzzlemaw</a> in there. For this reason, low level players visiting the museum should avoid wandering around this floor at night. On the third floor, <a href=\"#/wiki/Goldhanded%20Cultist\">Goldhanded Cultists</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Goldhanded%20Cultist%20Bride\">Goldhanded Cultist Brides</a> seem to be up to something dark. \n</p><p>One mission of the <a href=\"#/quest/cults-of-tibia-quest\">Cults of Tibia Quest</a> takes place here.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Second Floor (at night)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100p